# oh-my-codex runtime state and logs (added 2026-09-13, P4-T5).
# Every tracked file under .omx/ was session state that changes on each turn
# (hud-state, tmux-hook-state, notify-hook-state, per-day turn logs, metrics),
# so each commit either carried unrelated churn or left a permanently dirty
# tree. Nothing under .omx/ was configuration. Negate a specific path with
# `!.omx/<file>` if something there ever needs tracking.
.omx/
